00:07:13,500 --> 00:07:16,020
I'll launch the MapLocationFromContacts
application.

100
00:07:17,510 --> 00:07:21,440
And now you see a button that will
allow me to select an address from

101
00:07:21,440 --> 00:07:22,570
an existing contact.

102
00:07:23,860 --> 00:07:27,000
When I click on that button,
a new activity is started.

103
00:07:28,670 --> 00:07:33,470
Now, this activity is actually part of
the Contacts application which will

104
00:07:33,470 --> 00:07:36,730
show me my contacts and
