00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:30,980
So let's see that in the code.

118
00:08:32,250 --> 00:08:35,340
Now here, I'm opening
the MapLocationFromContacts application in

119
00:08:35,340 --> 00:08:36,890
Eclipse.

120
00:08:36,890 --> 00:08:39,820
And the structure of the main
activity is pretty similar to

121
00:08:39,820 --> 00:08:42,690
what we saw in MapLocation, but

122
00:08:42,690 --> 00:08:46,810
you'll notice that the code in the button
